00:05:20.140 --> 00:05:23.560
The deal responds to passenger demand for reliable connectivity.

00:05:23.560 --> 00:05:29.780
NEK Asia reports the deal as a direct response to passenger demand for reliable connectivity

00:05:29.780 --> 00:05:31.080
